<title>ITALY: Italian 10-yr bond spread over bunds at record low.</title>
<headline>Italian 10-yr bond spread over bunds at record low.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread between Italian 10-year Btp bonds over Bunds narrowed to a record 155 basis points as the March Btp Liffe contract soared to a new historic high above 130.80, traders said.</p>
<p>At 1452 GMT the spread was 156 bps while the March contract was quoted 45 bps up at 130.78 after touching 130.81.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
